```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "print the terms JSON the pūlama's lei act takes; writes nothing"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.lei.frames", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.lei.frames"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.lei.frames"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lei.frames ~ terms ~ one stdout line for the pūlama

`lares lei terms <kui|restring|unstring>` prints one stdout line: the terms JSON the pūlama's `lei <act>` takes, in its order, since the pūlama opens no document. `face` comes from `--face`, else for a keep the keep's face (whose keep lei stands, else h0), else the daemon mount; a restring's `after` from the line's tip. `kui --all` prints `{ "faces": [ … ] }`, one terms object per open face at its own tip. Each act takes only its own flags. It writes nothing and asks no route.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ kui

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`kui` params=`act/kui rite/kukulu branch/main returns/3 ~ the terms of a kui`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ act · rite · branch · reach · returns · head · after · lei · all · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`act` params=`takes/act needs/required seat/1 as/<act> ~ the pūlama act: kui, restring or unstring`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite needs/required ~ the rite the lei grants: push, kukulu or keep`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the lei's branch`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`reach` params=`takes/reach ~ beside kui or restring`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`returns` params=`takes/n ~ beside kui or restring`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit ~ beside kui or restring`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`after` params=`takes/cid ~ beside kui`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lei` params=`takes/cid ~ beside unstring`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`~ beside kui: every open face's terms`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose line this reads or strings, a whole count from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads the line and writes nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-none-open · swarm-lei-forked · swarm-lei-after-moved · swarm-lei-nothing-to-restring · keep-lei-unseen

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ a missing rite, branch or lei, a stray flag, or a malformed count`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-none-open` params=`~ no face stands open`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-forked` params=`~ the line forks; name one tip`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-after-moved` params=`~ no lei stands on the line to follow`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-nothing-to-restring` params=`~ no lei stands to restring`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-lei-unseen` params=`~ a keep lei may stand on a face shut or unread; open it or name --face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ terms

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`terms` params=`exit/0 ~ one JSON line the pūlama takes`>>
```

